412→/**
413→ * Execute a tool using the resolved executor configuration
414→ *
415→ * @param config - Resolved executor config (or null for default)
416→ * @param request - Tool execution request
417→ * @param sessionId - Optional session ID for sandbox executors
418→ * @returns Execution result
